title The line by the goal
intro A part of the field will glow. Then pick its name.
hide names
hide ball

step
  caption Look at the field…

step
  caption This line at the end of the field, by the goal, is glowing.
  draw goal-line left
  duration 400

question
  prompt What is that called?
  answer Goal line
  wrong Sideline
  wrong Halfway line
  wrong Center circle
  why The lines at each end are the goal lines. A goal only counts if the ball goes over this line into the net.
